    "updated_at": "2022-08-03T00:24:56Z",
    "body": "Container isn't a slot on the browsing context, it's a fact defined by \"The container of a [browsing context](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#browsing-context) bc is the [browsing context container](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#browsing-context-container) whose [nested browsing context](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#nested-browsing-context) is bc, or null if there is no such element.\". Step 3 is causing element to become the container of browsingContext.",
